    │ ? close help   Esc back / cancel   q quit   Ctrl-C quit                                  │
    │ ⣾  running    a turn is executing; the second line says what it is doing                 │
    │ ■  waiting    The delegate asked a question and needs a person                           │
    │ ✓  done       the turn finished; review it, then archive                                 │
    │ ×  failed     the turn ended with an error                                               │
    │ ◐ starting / unknown   ■ interrupted   ◌ lost                                            │
    │ ⠿ working subagent   · idle subagent                                                     │
    │ ━━━─── budget: time used of the turn's limit, not progress                               │
    │ foreman status --all for scripts and agents                                              │
    ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯









↑↓/jk select  Enter open  a answer  d defer  ! needs me  s steer  i interrupt  ? help  q quit"
`;

